# Copy to ~/.training-video-tools.conf and edit. Every setting can also be given as a flag on the command
# line, which wins over this file. This file is read, never run: KEY=value lines, # comments,
# optional quotes, and a leading ~ in a path means your home folder. Only what belongs to this
# machine goes here; nothing secret. Settings are provisional until PLAN.md specifies them.
#SPEECH_MODEL_DIR=~/models/kokoro
#VOICE=af_heart          # a default only: each video's settings choose its own voice
#SPEED=0.98
#VIDEO_ELEMENTS_DIR=~/projects/code/video-elements   # the library of drawn elements (PLAN.md item 15)
#RSVG_CONVERT=/usr/bin/rsvg-convert                   # only when rsvg-convert is not on PATH
#TIME_ZONE=Europe/London                             # record-output's times; unset, the machine's own zone
